        "original_id": "8ace2f0b-6b84-5363-93f8-f78200a222a5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Revenge of the Stepford Wives, Miami Vice, Nash Bridges\n- People: Robert Fuest, David Wiltse, Sharon Gless, Julie Kavner, Don Johnson, Arthur Hill, Audra Lindley, James \"Sonny\" Crockett\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, actor, lead role\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Fuest directed Revenge of the Stepford Wives.\n- David Wiltse wrote the screenplay for Revenge of the Stepford Wives.\n- Sharon Gless, Julie Kavner, Don Johnson, Arthur Hill, and Audra Lindley starred in Revenge of the Stepford Wives.\n- In the 1980s television series Miami Vice, Don Johnson played James \"Sonny\" Crockett.\n- In the 1990s cop series Nash Bridges, Don Johnson had the eponymous lead role.",
